  - robot_state_publisher (reads the URDF, broadcasts TF from joint_states)
  - ik_node (from-scratch C++ IK solver, publishes joint_states)
  - rviz2 (visualize the arm)

ROS2 launch files are themselves Python regardless of whether the nodes
they start are Python or C++ executables -- that doesn't change here. This
is the same launch file as robot_ik_pickplace/launch/ik_demo.launch.py,
pointed at the C++ package's executables instead.

